Package: com.ray.cc18native
Name: CC18 Native (iOS 15)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Native iOS 15 visual pass for the iOS 18 Control Center look.
 Hooks the real iOS 15 Control Center classes instead of loading the
 iOS 16-only ControlCenter18 binary.
 .
 v0.1 applies 26pt continuous corners, dark module borders and circular
 button styling to CCUIContentModuleContainerView / CCUIRoundButton, with a
 forced walk from SBControlCenterController -_didPresent so later-created
 modules are covered.
Maintainer: Ray
Author: Ray
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate | ellekit, firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<< 16.0)
